{"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"f408039dc3a9b0d2e0e8d246c126af892839cee8","body":"Creating or changing a regular file at the repository's `state` path previously escaped the test-state guard. The approved ITEM5-B-KIT-REVIEW-01 payload hashes that root file and adds nested-pytest coverage for new, modified and unchanged baselines. The shared upgrade wording describes rendered-text comparison after newline normalization. The release manifest and supplied changelog entry carry the approved changes.\n\nThe independent panel reviewed `b018a0544c44028c21399ad073ce8a3dee3bfd45` on 2026-09-10. Its complete [adversarial report](https://github.com/topij/agentic-dev-kit/pull/731#issuecomment-5624451599) records an inherited P2 FIFO-root detection limitation; its [correctness report](https://github.com/topij/agentic-dev-kit/pull/731#issuecomment-5624454595) records a P3 root-symlink coverage gap. Both were posted and read back before follow-up preparation. Neither is a clean-review gate receipt.\n\nThe [ITEM5-B-KIT-REVIEW-02 packet](https://github.com/topij/agentic-dev-kit/blob/4a4820a721462ad133db861cd9819d59cd35157a/saved_plans/phase5-item5-b-review-followup-decision_2026-09-10.md) is prepared and unapproved. It proposes explicit acceptance/documentation of the inherited limitation, compatibility tests and matching release hashes. Candidate payloads are evidence only and have not been applied. The record commit `4a4820a721462ad133db861cd9819d59cd35157a` leaves REVIEW-01's production files unchanged. The archived reports preserve their original bytes and original scratch-path references; the evidence hash index locates retained artifacts, with the full review diff stored as lossless gzip.\n\nVerification: `make test` in `/Users/topi/Coding/agentic-dev-kit` at `1f6195d64482bef4a5437c1eff3a07069e2b14b8` on 2026-09-10 printed `1 failed, 2503 passed, 1 skipped in 389.80s (0:06:29)`. The failure is the disclosed #393 deep-JSON hook case. The manifest self-check and separate shell parses for #561 are recorded with their actual commands/results in the [execution record](https://github.com/topij/agentic-dev-kit/blob/4a4820a721462ad133db861cd9819d59cd35157a/saved_plans/phase5-item5-b-kit-repair-execution_2026-09-10.md). The independent reports retain their own full local runs.\n\nHosted verification at `4a4820a721462ad133db861cd9819d59cd35157a` on 2026-09-10 succeeded in [run 34523682863](https://github.com/topij/agentic-dev-kit/actions/runs/34523682863/job/103027272537). `gh run view 34523682863 --repo topij/agentic-dev-kit --job 103027272537 --log`, read from `/Users/topi/Coding/agentic-dev-kit`, returned `2502 passed, 3 skipped in 222.65s (0:03:42)` and the no-PyYAML result `92 passed, 2 skipped in 1.03s`. Hosted success does not resolve the review findings or establish independent review of this record head.\n\nMerge class: **operator-merge**. Review is paused pending ITEM5-B-KIT-REVIEW-02; no clean-review receipt, handled-round acknowledgment or merge is claimed. Retained fixture/source writes, baseline refresh, initialization, client/trust/profile changes, tracker payloads and fixture PR closure/merge remain excluded. Phase 5 item 5 remains incomplete; item 6's completed replay is preserved.\n","headRefName":"chore/item5-b-review-repair-20260910","headRefOid":"4a4820a721462ad133db861cd9819d59cd35157a","isDraft":false,"state":"OPEN","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-10T20:03:54Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/topij/agentic-dev-kit/actions/runs/34523682863/job/103027272537","name":"toolkit","startedAt":"2026-09-10T19:59:58Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Test"},{"__typename":"StatusContext","context":"CodeRabbit","startedAt":"2026-09-10T19:59:57Z","state":"SUCCESS","targetUrl":""}],"url":"https://github.com/topij/agentic-dev-kit/pull/731"}
